        81,
        103
      ],
      "claim": "JavaScript extraction accepts unsupported top-level spread entries and duplicate flag properties.",
      "reproduction": "An entry with readOnly:true followed by readOnly:false emits read_only:true though JavaScript uses the last value. Adding ...dynamicCommands at the registry top level succeeds and omits the spread commands.",
